#~ msgstr "dodani u standardnom kalendaru"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Select this option to always record new events, to-dos and journal "
#~ "entries using the standard calendar."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Odaberite ovu opciju da uvijek snimate nove događaje, zadatke i dnevničke "
